  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳知道傷藥嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B377E5905350B785E555CEFF1F00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳知道傷藥嗎？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n請幫在對戰中受傷的\n寶可夢用這個吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B377E5905350B785E555CEFF1F00100001BE01000A8ACB5E6B57285C0D62304E2D53D750B77684000A5BF653EF592275289019500B5427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要使用傷藥，\n就算不去寶可夢中心，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n也可以幫寶可夢恢復活力！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 1004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA89814F7F752850B785E5FF0C000A5C317B974E0D53BB5BF653EF59224E2D5FC3FF0C00100001BE00000A4E5F53EF4EE55E6B5BF653EF592260625FA96D3B529BFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0003>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 1076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00030000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要來一個嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89814F864E00500B55CEFF1F00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "免費送您一個\n密阿雷格雷派餅。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "514D8CBB900160A84E00500B000A5BC6963F96F7683C96F76D3E990530020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "免費的密阿雷格雷派餅\n一個人只能領一個。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "514D8CBB76845BC6963F96F7683C96F76D3E9905000A4E00500B4EBA53EA80FD98184E00500B30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "準備好精靈球了嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6E965099597D7CBE974874034E8655CEFF1F00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果要進去野生特區，\n精靈球可以說是必備品嘛。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C8981903253BB91CE751F72795340FF0C000A7CBE9748740353EF4EE58AAA662F5FC5509954C1561B30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "先按<U+0010><U+0002>봊<U+0002>ZL好好瞄準目標以後，\n再把精靈球投出去吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5148630900100002BD0A0002005A004C597D597D77846E9676EE6A194EE55F8CFF0C000A518D628A7CBE97487403629551FA53BB5427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "移動地點！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "79FB52D557309EDEFF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是有第一次看到的寶可夢中心，\n就去看看吧！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n因為這樣就能讓<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳去過的每一間，\n都作為<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>移動地點<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>被登錄到地圖裡喔。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n另外為了讓這個爆讚資訊留在\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的記憶裡，請收下瞬發之羽！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 111
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也就是說，<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳越是在密阿雷四處逛逛，\n就會越方便去各種地方！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F5C31662F8AAAFF0C00100003110000FF01014F6059B38D8A662F57285BC6963F96F756DB8655901B901BFF0C000A5C3167038D8A65B94FBF53BB54047A2E573065B9FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "茉蜜姬調查！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8309871C59EC8ABF67E5FF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我把棲息在3號野生特區\n所有種類的野生寶可夢都捉到以後，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n就獲得茉蜜姬調查的報酬了！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n因為我太高興了，用剩的球就送<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211628A68F2606F57280033865F91CE751F72795340000A624067097A2E985E768491CE751F5BF653EF592290FD634952304EE55F8CFF0C00100001BE00000A5C3173725F978309871C59EC8ABF67E576845831916C4E86FF0100100001BE01000A56E070BA6211592A9AD882084E86FF0C75285269768474035C31900100100003110000FF01014F6059B3542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要努力完成茉蜜姬調查，\n就會有滿滿的好事喔！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA898152AA529B5B8C62108309871C59EC8ABF67E5FF0C000A5C31670367096EFF6EFF7684597D4E8B5594FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "全像傳送梯！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "516850CF50B3900168AFFF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我對全像傳送梯還不是很清楚，\n但它運用最新技術實現了上下之間的傳送！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n因為那東西厲害到太令我驚訝了，\n所以我要送<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳一樣好東西！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115C0D516850CF50B3900168AF90844E0D662F5F886E05695AFF0C000A4F465B83904B7528670065B0628088535BE673FE4E864E0A4E0B4E4B9593768450B39001FF0100100001BE01000A56E070BA90A36771897F53B25BB35230592A4EE462119A5A8A1D4E86FF0C000A62404EE562118981900100100003110000FF01014F6059B34E006A23597D6771897FFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳如果發現了全像傳送梯，\n請務必使用看看喔！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B35982679C767C73FE4E86516850CF50B3900168AFFF0C000A8ACB52D95FC54F7F7528770B770B5594FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對我來說，\n第2重要的是錢。<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D62114F868AAAFF0C000A7B2C003291CD89817684662F9322300200100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷到處都有閃閃發光的東西掉在地上，\n只要收集起來賣掉，<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳馬上就是有錢人！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n來！我收集來的小蘑菇送<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳當禮物，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳就到寶可夢中心把它賣掉吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不可思議的是，\n閃閃發光的東西會重新冒出來喔。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D53EF601D8B707684662FFF0C000A95839583767C514976846771897F670391CD65B0519251FA4F86559430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我這裡有個好東西。<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211901988E16709500B597D6771897F300200100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然可麗餅賣完了，\n但我這裡有個好東西。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n來！先制之爪！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D6713653EF9E9799058CE35B8C4E86FF0C000A4F466211901988E16709500B597D6771897F300200100001BE00000A4F86FF01514852364E4B722AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "攜帶著先制之爪的寶可夢，\n有時可以更快地使出招式喔！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "651C5E368457514852364E4B722A76845BF653EF5922FF0C000A6709664253EF4EE566F45FEB57304F7F51FA62DB5F0F5594FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "廊街！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5ECA8857FF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳就用賣掉美麗之羽的錢\n去買美麗的物品如何？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B35C3175288CE363897F8E9E974E4B7FBD76849322000A53BB8CB77F8E9E977684726954C159824F55FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果想要換裝的話，\n只要打開主選單，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n然後按按看<U+0010><U+0002>봊<U+0005>Minus鍵就行囉！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C60F3898163DB88DD76848A71FF0C000A53EA89816253958B4E3B907855AEFF0C00100001BE00000A71365F8C63096309770B00100002BD0A0005004D0069006E0075007393755C31884C56C9FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿#",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00230000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "經驗糖果！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7D939A577CD6679CFF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳知道經驗糖果嗎？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n只要給寶可夢經驗糖果，\n不知為何經驗值就會提升呢！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我分幾個讓<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳確認看看吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B377E590537D939A577CD6679C55CEFF1F00100001BE01000A53EA89817D665BF653EF59227D939A577CD6679CFF0C000A4E0D77E570BA4F557D939A57503C5C31670363D053475462FF0100100001BE00000A621152065E7E500B8B9300100003110000FF01014F6059B378BA8A8D770B770B542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "能夠提升經驗值的經驗糖果……\n吃起來是大人的味道嗎？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 3104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "80FD592063D053477D939A57503C76847D939A577CD6679C20262026000A54038D774F86662F59274EBA76845473905355CEFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿'",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 3160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "招式學習器！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 3172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62DB5F0F5B787FD25668FF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果有個洞，真想鑽進去……\n但洞並不是想找就能找得到的……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n這時就只能用挖的了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 3216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C6709500B6D1EFF0C771F60F3947D903253BB20262026000A4F466D1E4E264E0D662F60F3627E5C3180FD627E5F97523076842026202600100001BE00000A901966425C3153EA80FD7528631676844E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "挖洞是先潛入地下隱藏身影一會兒後，\n再朝著對手發動攻擊的招式！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n沒錯！鑽進地下就誰都找不到了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 3304,
