      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 3408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "逛街提示。<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 3420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "901B885763D0793A300200100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一邊確認逛街提示一邊逛街！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n當然補充水分也是很重要的喔。\n我也把水送給訓練家<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿ̃先生你小姐妳喝吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 3460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E00908A78BA8A8D901B885763D0793A4E00908A901B8857FF0100100001BE01000A7576713688DC51456C3452064E5F662F5F8891CD8981768455943002000A62114E5F628A6C3490017D668A137DF45BB600100003110000FF03035148751F4F605C0F59D059B3559D5427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果想要確認逛街提示，\n就從主選單按<U+0010><U+0002>봊<U+0001>L吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 3572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C60F3898178BA8A8D901B885763D0793AFF0C000A5C315F9E4E3B907855AE630900100002BD0A0001004C542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿/",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 3624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嘿！計程車！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 3636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "563FFF018A087A0B8ECAFF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "坐計程車的好處就是\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳還沒去過的地方它也能帶<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳去！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n也就是說，能增加移動地點唷！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 3680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "57508A087A0B8ECA7684597D86555C31662F000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B390846C9253BB904E7684573065B95B834E5F80FD5E3600100003110000FF01014F6059B353BBFF0100100001BE00000A4E5F5C31662F8AAAFF0C80FD589E52A079FB52D557309EDE5537FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只不過司機的聊天功力，\n就是需要碰運氣的了……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 3792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA4E0D904E53F86A5F7684804A5929529F529BFF0C000A5C31662F9700898178B0904B6C2376844E86202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 3840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "奇怪的樹果！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 3852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5947602A76846A39679CFF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "樹果真的好不可思議！\n它們隱藏著各式各樣的效果喔。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n所以<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳要不要來一個呢？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 3896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6A39679C771F7684597D4E0D53EF601D8B70FF01000A5B83501196B185CF845754045F0F54046A2376846548679C5594300200100001BE00000A62404EE500100003110000FF01014F6059B389814E0D89814F864E00500B5462FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等確認好樹果的說明後，\n就靈活地使用看看吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 3992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B4978BA8A8D597D6A39679C76848AAA660E5F8CFF0C000A5C3197486D3B57304F7F7528770B770B5427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿7",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 4040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "將這個招式學習器！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 4052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C079019500B62DB5F0F5B787FD25668FF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "讓我預知未來！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n就是我馬上會送<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳一個\n招式學習器。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 4100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B936211981077E5672A4F86FF0100100001BE01000A5C31662F621199AC4E0A6703900100100003110000FF01014F6059B34E00500B000A62DB5F0F5B787FD2566830020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要使用預知未來這個招式，\n就會在過一段時間後，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n向對手發送一團念力來攻擊呢。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 4172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA89814F7F7528981077E5672A4F869019500B62DB5F0FFF0C000A5C3167035728904E4E006BB5664295935F8CFF0C00100001BE00000A54115C0D624B767C90014E0057185FF5529B4F86653B64CA546230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿;",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 4260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF003B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳有在拍照嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 4272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B36709572862CD716755CEFF1F00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "按<U+0010><U+0002>봊<U+0005>Minus拍出的照片可以做\n各式各樣的嘗試，真是神奇呢。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n所以既然提到了神奇，這個就給<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 4328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "630900100002BD0A0005004D0069006E0075007362CD51FA76847167724753EF4EE5505A000A54045F0F54046A23768456178A66FF0C771F662F795E59475462300200100001BE00000A62404EE565E2713663D052304E86795E5947FF0C9019500B5C317D6600100003110000FF01014F6059B35427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "按<U+0010><U+0002>봊<U+0005>Minus拍照！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n然後用濾鏡功能改變照片風格，\n或是播放音樂改變照片氛圍，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n多多嘗試會很有意思的喔！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 4452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "630900100002BD0A0005004D0069006E0075007362CD7167FF0100100001BE01000A71365F8C75286FFE93E1529F80FD65398B8A7167724798A8683CFF0C000A6216662F64AD653E97F36A0265398B8A716772476C1B570DFF0C00100001BE00000A591A591A56178A6667035F886709610F601D76845594FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 4576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "餐廳的全餐！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 4588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "99105EF3768451689910FF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我要去餐廳\n挑戰寶可夢對戰全餐！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n沒錯！凡事都是經驗。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 4632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211898153BB99105EF3000A631162305BF653EF59225C0D623051689910FF0100100001BE00000A6C92932FFF0151E14E8B90FD662F7D939A5730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "最一開始要挑戰的是\n一星的譜通餐館！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 4696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67004E00958B59CB8981631162307684662F000A4E00661F76848B5C901A99109928FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿C",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 4736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "彩色螺絲！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 4748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F69827287BA7D72FF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然很突然，\n但我要送<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳密阿雷格雷派餅。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我旁邊的人做的密阿雷格雷派餅可是極品喔。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 4788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D671365F887A817136FF0C000A4F4662118981900100100003110000FF01014F6059B35BC6963F96F7683C96F76D3E9905300200100001BE00000A621165C1908A76844EBA505A76845BC6963F96F7683C96F76D3E990553EF662F697554C1559430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "把彩色螺絲收集起來，\n然後拿去木根工程吧。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n沿著這條路往那一側稍微走一段路，\n就可以找到木根工程囉。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 4892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "628A5F69827287BA7D72653696C68D774F86FF0C000A71365F8C62FF53BB672868395DE57A0B5427300200100001BE01000A6CBF84579019689D8DEF5F8090A34E0050747A0D5FAE8D704E006BB58DEFFF0C000A5C3153EF4EE5627E5230672868395DE57A0B56C930020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿G",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 71,
      "offsetInSection": 5000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00470000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我要買超級石囉！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 72,
      "offsetInSection": 5012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621189818CB78D857D1A77F356C9FF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要有活力碎片，\n瀕死的寶可夢也能繼續對戰！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n畢竟不能對戰，\n就代表不能超級進化了嘛。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 73,
      "offsetInSection": 5060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA898167096D3B529B788E7247FF0C000A70156B7B76845BF653EF59224E5F80FD7E7C7E8C5C0D6230FF0100100001BE01000A75627ADF4E0D80FD5C0D6230FF0C000A5C314EE388684E0D80FD8D857D1A903253164E86561B30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在春日大道的<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>石頭館<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>\n能買到超級石！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n但是賣的價錢很貴，\n得參加ZA登峰戰存錢才行呢！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 74,
      "offsetInSection": 5156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5728662565E559279053768400100002FF00000677F3982D992800100002FF000000000A80FD8CB752308D857D1A77F3FF0100100001BE01000A4F46662F8CE3768450F993225F888CB4FF0C000A5F9753C352A0005A0041767B5CF062305B589322624D884C5462FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿K",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 75,
      "offsetInSection": 5264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF004B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "捕捉你的心……！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 76,
      "offsetInSection": 5276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "635563494F6076845FC320262026FF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "電網這個招式能捉住眾人的心不放。\n這是它的招式學習器喔。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 77,
      "offsetInSection": 5324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96FB7DB29019500B62DB5F0F80FD63494F4F773E4EBA76845FC34E0D653E3002000A9019662F5B83768462DB5F0F5B787FD25668559430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "電網是用帶電的網子\n捕捉對手進行攻擊的招式。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n捕捉對方這一點\n就好像奇樹大人一樣呢！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 78,
      "offsetInSection": 5384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96FB7DB2662F75285E3696FB76847DB25B50000A635563495C0D624B9032884C653B64CA768462DB5F0F300200100001BE01000A635563495C0D65B990194E009EDE000A5C31597D50CF59476A3959274EBA4E006A235462FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿O",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 79,
      "offsetInSection": 5476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF004F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "痕跡很礙事對吧？<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 80,
      "offsetInSection": 5488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75D58DE15F8879194E8B5C0D5427FF1F00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果把痕跡破壞掉，\n就可以得到超級碎片這點是很好啦……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 81,
      "offsetInSection": 5536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C628A75D58DE1783458DE6389FF0C000A5C3153EF4EE55F9752308D857D1A788E724790199EDE662F5F88597D5566202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但像岩石、藤蔓、污泥之類的痕跡，\n並不是任何招式都有辦法消除，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n所以必須得多番嘗試才行啊。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 82,
      "offsetInSection": 5592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4650CF5CA977F3300185E4851330016C616CE54E4B985E768475D58DE1FF0C000A4E264E0D662F4EFB4F5562DB5F0F90FD67098FA66CD56D889664FF0C00100001BE00000A62404EE55FC598085F97591A756A56178A66624D884C554A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿S",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 83,
      "offsetInSection": 5692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00530000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "時尚就從頭髮開始！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 84,
      "offsetInSection": 5704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "66425C1A5C315F9E982D9AEE958B59CBFF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "說到美麗，就會想到\n美麗之羽和美麗的頭髮！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 85,
      "offsetInSection": 5752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8AAA52307F8E9E97FF0C5C31670360F35230000A7F8E9E974E4B7FBD548C7F8E9E977684982D9AEEFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我正在看的是包廂沙龍。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n因為可以請他們設計髮型和染髮，\n所以總有一天我要去那裡變得美美的！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 86,
      "offsetInSection": 5796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62116B635728770B7684662F53055EC26C999F8D300200100001BE01000A56E070BA53EF4EE58ACB4ED650118A2D8A089AEE578B548C67D39AEEFF0C000A62404EE57E3D67094E0059296211898153BB90A388E18B8A5F977F8E7F8E7684FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿W",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 87,
      "offsetInSection": 5896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00570000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我最愛的招式……<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 88,
      "offsetInSection": 5908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62116700611B768462DB5F0F2026202600100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請收下……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 89,
      "offsetInSection": 5956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB65364E0B202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "詛咒這個招式……\n如果給幽靈屬性的……寶可夢用，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n效果就會變成……施加詛咒……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 90,
      "offsetInSection": 5968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A5B54929019500B62DB5F0F20262026000A5982679C7D665E7D97485C6C60277684202620265BF653EF59227528FF0C00100001BE00000A6548679C5C3167038B8A62102026202665BD52A08A5B5492202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿[",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 91,
      "offsetInSection": 6056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF005B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "地圖的哪邊才是前面……？<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 92,
      "offsetInSection": 6068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "57305716768454EA908A624D662F524D976220262026FF1F00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "超級……\n眼花……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 93,
      "offsetInSection": 6124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D857D1A20262026000A773C82B1202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "從主選單的選項\n能設定是否要讓迷你地圖旋轉喔。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我自己是偏好讓它旋轉，\n但有的人說不定反而會昏頭轉向呢。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 94,
      "offsetInSection": 6144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F9E4E3B907855AE768490789805000A80FD8A2D5B9A662F542689818B938FF74F605730571665CB8F495594300200100001BE01000A621181EA5DF1662F504F597D8B935B8365CB8F49FF0C000A4F46670976844EBA8AAA4E0D5B9A53CD800C6703660F982D8F495411546230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿_",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 95,
      "offsetInSection": 6256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF005F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "精靈球館～！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 96,
      "offsetInSection": 6268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7CBE974874039928FF5EFF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "先給<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳這個！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 97,
      "offsetInSection": 6312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51487D6600100003110000FF01014F6059B39019500BFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那間店叫做<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>精靈球館<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>，\n在那裡可以買到稀有的精靈球喔。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 98,
      "offsetInSection": 6340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A395935E9753EB505A00100002FF0000067CBE97487403992800100002FF000000FF0C000A572890A388E153EF4EE58CB752307A00670976847CBE97487403559430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿c",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 99,
      "offsetInSection": 6412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "今晚也要大賺一筆！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 100,
      "offsetInSection": 6424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ECA665A4E5F898159278CFA4E007B46FF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對戰特區是很好賺\n零用錢的地方！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 101,
      "offsetInSection": 6472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D623072795340662F5F88597D8CFA000A96F6752893227684573065B9FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一個晚上贏得越多就賺得越多！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n如果覺得去寶可夢中心的時間很可惜，\n建議<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳可以使用傷藥等道具！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 102,
      "offsetInSection": 6508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E00500B665A4E0A8D0F5F978D8A591A5C318CFA5F978D8A591AFF0100100001BE01000A5982679C89BA5F9753BB5BF653EF59224E2D5FC37684664295935F8853EF60DCFF0C000A5EFA8B7000100003110000FF01014F6059B353EF4EE54F7F752850B785E57B4990535177FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿g",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 103,
      "offsetInSection": 6620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我來幫寶可夢\n恢復活力！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 104,
      "offsetInSection": 6632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114F865E6B5BF653EF5922000A60625FA96D3B529BFF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一個禮拜前這裡還是可麗餅店，\n但因為我一時興起，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n決定把這裡稱作寶可夢中心了！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n所以事不宜遲，\n請將您的寶可夢交給我吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 105,
      "offsetInSection": 6688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E00500B79AE62DC524D901988E19084662F53EF9E9799055E97FF0C000A4F4656E070BA62114E00664282088D77FF0C00100001BE00000A6C7A5B9A628A901988E17A314F5C5BF653EF59224E2D5FC34E86FF0100100001BE01000A62404EE54E8B4E0D5B9C9072FF0C000A8ACB5C0760A876845BF653EF59224EA47D666211542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有一間好方便！移動式寶可夢中心\n來幫您的寶可夢恢復活力！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 106,
      "offsetInSection": 6824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67094E009593597D65B94FBFFF0179FB52D55F0F5BF653EF59224E2D5FC3000A4F865E6B60A876845BF653EF592260625FA96D3B529BFF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "您交給我的<U+0010><U+0002>ā<U+0002>\n已經恢復活力囉！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 107,
      "offsetInSection": 6884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60A84EA47D66621176840010000201010002000A5DF27D9360625FA96D3B529B56C9FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我來幫寶可夢\n恢復活力！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 108,
      "offsetInSection": 6924,
